      <h2>Open Questions</h2>

      <div class="fact-grid">
        <div class="fact-card">
          <span>Open Question</span>
          <p>
            The order required a transfer "within seven business days". Was
            any interest transferred, by deed, into trust, or into escrow? The
            deed index was not read.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact-card">
          <span>Open Question</span>
          <p>
            Which properties are the "post-closing properties"? The order does
            not list them.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact-card">
          <span>Open Question</span>
          <p>
            The order called for a joint status update "in 90 days". Was one
            filed, and has either side filed for arbitration? The court's
            docket was not read.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact-card">
          <span>Open Question</span>
          <p>
            Is the plaintiff in this case the company with Georgia control
            number 24062142? The order prints the name and no number.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact-card">
          <span>Open Question</span>
          <p>
            Who are "the Company's other investors"? The order does not name
            them.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="fact-card">
          <span>Open Question</span>
          <p>
            Has the order been changed, appealed or set aside since May 2026?
            Only this one order was read.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

